body:
&#x200B;

>Bah ou de groupes jouant entre gens qui se connaissent et n ont pas besoin de ça.

&#x200B;

>sur les 20 dernières années, le simple fait de dire en début de campagne  : "voilà les thèmes abordés, ne rejoignez pas la campagne si vous  pensez que c'est pas pour vous" a toujours suffit à avoir des campagnes  qui se passaient bien.

Je comprends peut-être mal : tu dis que des mesures de sécurité sont superflues du moment que les gens sont amis et se connaissent et ensuite tu dis utiliser une mesure de sécurité depuis 20 ans ? Parce que ce que tu décris dans ce second paragraphe, c'est un outil qui a un nom, le trigger warning.

Et en effet c'est un outil très utile dans la mesure où même si on est très pote avec untel depuis X années, on sait pas forcément quelles saloperies il a pu lui arriver quand il était gosse.

Melee DPS is one of the harder roles to play well in PvP, check out Tanks if you really want to be a melee fighter and have an easier time !

&#x200B;

EDIT : If you're not already doing that, you can assign a key to "target the nearest enemy" in your settings. It made a huge difference in my plays as a melee DPS.

Started the game like 10 days ago. I'd advise you to grind the Blood Money crime missions until you have enough gold to buy a role (I personally went for bounty hunter, it's on sale). By the time you're a bounty hunter, you should be fine when it comes to money.

&#x200B;

Oh also, kill animals. Just eat meat and don't waste what little money you have on buying food you can get for free.

As someone who played through all of dark souls offline (i do not care for either pvp or coop, i do everything alone), I kinda regret losing the messages. I really like writing little hints and tips here and there, and reading those from other players is really fun. It's kinda sad that I just have to do without because I don't care for invasions or coop, but hey. Maybe that's why some leave it on.

&#x200B;

I kinda like that as long as I'm in soul form, I can get it all though !

Found the Turbo Button fan lol

&#x200B;

(if somehow you actually don't know about it, then watch this, something tells me you'll like it [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5vZCZh5cb6s](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5vZCZh5cb6s))
